NOTES = {
    # ---------------- Jablunkovsko–Třinecko
    '764': 'Loop Třinec – Vendryně – Karpentná – Třinec every 2 h at :35 in the morning (8:35, 10:35, 12:35), then 13:35, 14:20, 16:35, 18:35. One bus every 180 with two slots, 13:35 and 14:20 (also 16:35, 10:35 on the minute). 12:35 and 18:35 are 60 min off the pattern; 14:40 to Záolší only is not a loop trip.',
    '766': 'The same loop the other way round: 9:35, 11:35, 13:35 and 15:40 (the 13:24 is a Záolší – Třinec trip passing the bus station). One bus every 120 at 15:40 (odd hours :40, so 9:35–13:35 are 5 min early against it).',
    '769': 'Třinec – Lyžbice – Vendryně hourly: Třinec :35, Vendryně :00 most of the day.',
    '770': 'Bystřice, station – Paseky about hourly at irregular minutes: station 13:10, 13:45, 14:51, 15:55, 17:45, 18:50; Paseky 13:30, 15:05, 16:50, 18:00 (the 14:00 from Paseky runs to Třinec without the station). No hourly slot passes Step 4 (13:30 and 15:05 are 95 min apart), and one slot every 120 would halve the line, so every 180 with two slots each way, exact in the model hours: station 13:45 and 14:51 (also 16:45, 17:51), Paseky 13:30 and 15:05 (also 16:30, 18:05); two buses (one more; the one-bus option is on the owner checks). Off the pattern: 13:10, 15:55, 18:50 out, 16:50, 19:00 back; their stops are all on this line. The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec) is the one that runs.',
    '771': 'Bystřice – Nýdek, náměstí every 1–2 h at irregular minutes (station 13:05, 13:50, 16:45, 17:45; Nýdek 14:00, 15:10, 18:00, 19:00). One bus every 120: station 13:50 (odd hours :50), Nýdek 14:00 (even hours :00, on the minute at 8:00, 12:00, 14:00 and 18:00); the real bus turns at Nýdek in 2 min. The Setinka trips (Bystřice 15:10 via náměstí) are left out of these rows: the few Hluchová trips are 771 Hluchová, every 480 on the afternoon pair (Bystřice 12:25, Setinka 12:47; 4:37 back in the morning); 14:50 from Třinec to Setinka is listed off the pattern. Hluchová has no other line.',
    '772': 'Třinec – Bystřice – Nýdek, Gora every 3 h (Třinec 15:40, Gora 16:45).',
    '773': 'Bystřice – Nýdek, Střelmá: a few short workings a day. Every 480 on the afternoon pair (Nýdek, náměstí 12:33 → Střelmá, 12:42 back to Bystřice), timed at Bystřice so the bus passes náměstí at 12:33; 4:20 from Bystřice fits too. Střelmá has no other line.',
    '781': 'Návsí – Jablunkov – Mosty, Šance about hourly (Návsí :58 / :03, Šance :25 / :30), but in the afternoon the 15:03 is replaced by the Třinec through trip (Návsí 14:43) and the 16:30 back by a Hrčava trip, so no hourly slot passes Step 4. Every 120 with two slots each way, exact in the model hours: Návsí 14:03 and 14:43 (even hours), Šance 14:35 (even) and 15:30 (odd); two buses, as before (the live map’s 7E18816 runs 14:03 → 14:35, 74-1105 runs 14:43 → 15:30 → 16:03). 12:58 and 17:03 out, 12:25, 13:25, 18:30 back are off the pattern (5–20 min). The Hrčava trips (also those via Šance: Návsí 10:58, 18:58) are 781 Hrčava from Jablunkov every 3 h (15:00 out, 14:06 / 17:06 back).',
    '782': 'Návsí – Radvanov – Jablunkov: one afternoon round (Návsí 14:55 → Radvanov, 15:05 → Jablunkov), every 480; the bus returns to Návsí empty (5 min). Radvanov has no other line.',
    '783': 'Třinec – Jablunkov – Písečná – Bukovec, the valley trunk. Out of Třinec hourly at :05 most of the day, with a bunch 13:00–15:13 (13:28, 14:15, 14:35, 15:13); back from Bukovec to Třinec 13:32, 14:17, 15:15 (timed at Jablunkov :52 / :37 / :37). The main rows count the trips that run through to Bukovec. Every 180 with three slots each way, exact in the model hours: Třinec 13:28, 14:15, 15:13; Bukovec 13:32, 14:17, 15:17 (Jablunkov 13:52, 14:37, 15:37); three buses (was four). Off the pattern: 14:35 out (74-1112 stays in the valley, Bukovec 15:37 to Návsí), 13:00, 16:10, 18:18; back 13:07, 16:37; and the Návsí / Jablunkov – Bukovec and Třinec – Jablunkov short trips (their stops are on this line). Návsí – Písečná točna every 90 is 783 Písečná (with the Třinec – Písečná trips 14:18, 18:05); the Ski areál trips (Třinec 14:00) every 480 are 783 Ski areál, which also serves Hraniční přechod and Písek, škola, so the few trips via the border crossing (Bukovec 13:00, Třinec 6:28) have no line of their own.',
    '784': 'Návsí – Dolní Lomná – Horní Lomná, Horní Přelač about hourly (Návsí :55, 16:00, 17:00; Přelač :25, 14:30, 15:30, 18:30), timed so the bus passes Horní Lomná, střed on time. No hourly slot is exact (the afternoon drifts to :00 / :30), so every 180 with two slots each way, exact: Návsí 14:55 and 16:00, Přelač 14:30 and 16:25 (the 16:00 and 16:25 are the trips that turn at Horní Lomná, střed). Two buses, as seen. Off the pattern: 12:55, 13:55, 17:00, 18:05 out; 12:25, 15:30, 17:25, 18:30 back.',
    '786': 'Jablunkov – Milíkov – Bystřice, Na Paseky: one round every 4 h (Jablunkov 13:33, Paseky 14:57). The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec) runs. Bocanovice has no other line.',
    '787': 'Jablunkov – Návsí – Milíkov – Bystřice, Na Paseky. Jablunkov sends few trips (12:25, 14:15, 14:50, then 20:23), Paseky more (12:56, 13:56, 14:44, 16:01, 17:56, 19:01; the buses run Košařiska and Milíkov shorts in between). One bus every 120: Jablunkov 14:50 (even hours :50), Paseky :58 in odd hours (13:58, 15:58, 17:58: within 3 min of 13:56, 16:01, 17:56); 74-1001 runs 14:50 out and 16:01 back on the live map. 14:15 and 14:44 are off the pattern. The Třinec – Bystřice trips are 787 Třinec, one bus every 90 (Třinec 14:59, Paseky 15:24). The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec) runs.',
    '788': 'Jablunkov – Lísky: four rounds a day, every 240 (Jablunkov 15:10, Lísky 15:20).',
    # ---------------- Českotěšínsko
    '731': 'Český Těšín – Albrechtice every 3 h (15:38 / 16:05). The shift trips on to Stonava and Karviná, Důl Darkov (Svibice 12:35, Darkov 6:09 and 14:09) have no line of their own: their stops are on 731 and on the Havířovsko/Karvinsko/Orlovsko lines (563, 582 ČSM). Regular route, not the Stonava mines diversion (network state).',
    '739': 'Český Těšín – Třanovice – Dobrá – Frýdek every 4 h (14:15 / 15:00). Třanovice, Na Cymbálce has no other line.',
    '743': 'Hnojník – Střítež – Řeka every 3 h (13:15 / 13:35).',
    '732': 'Jablunkov/Třinec – Český Těšín – Těrlicko – Havířov, Město, station, about hourly at irregular minutes, read at Český Těšín, autobusová stanice (the knot every trip passes). In the model hours (13:00–15:00) two trips run towards Havířov (Třinec 13:25 and 14:55, Těšín 13:45 and 15:15) and five leave Havířov (13:17, 13:52, 14:07, 14:27, 14:35): the extra buses go on to other lines at Český Těšín and Třinec (14:07 ends at Těšín and goes on as 734, 13:17 goes on as 733, 14:35 runs on to Jablunkov). So the line runs at the rate towards Havířov: every 180 with two slots each way, Třinec 13:25 / 14:55 (Těšín 13:45 / 15:15, exact) and Havířov 13:52 / 14:27 (the turns of 73-0009 and 73-0016); the other Havířov departures are off the pattern. The trips to Havířov, Podlesí, Těšínská (Třinec 14:10, 14:15, 15:50) and the Těšín – Havířov short trips are not on this line; their stops are on other lines. Two buses.',
    '733': 'Český Těšín – Těrlicko, Hradiště, U Stonávky: out-and-back rounds every 1½–2 h (Těšín 13:15, 14:50, 16:45, 18:35; U Stonávky 13:41, 15:29, 17:10). In the model hours one trip out (14:50) and two back (13:41, 15:29): every 120, Těšín 14:50 and U Stonávky 15:29, both exact, one bus. Off the pattern: 13:15, 16:45 (5 min) and 18:35 out, 13:41 and 17:10 back, and the short trips to Kaménka and to Třinec.',
    '734': 'Short trips between the Třinec and Český Těšín bus stations about every 1–1½ h at irregular times (Třinec 12:40, 14:20, 15:30, 17:30, 19:10; Těšín 13:05, 14:05, 15:05, 16:05). Every 180 with two slots each way: Třinec 14:20 and 15:30, Těšín 15:05 and 16:05 (13:05 exact too), all exact, one bus (73-0021 turns at Třinec 15:26 → 15:30). Off the pattern 12:40, 17:30 (10 min) and 19:10 out, 14:05 back.',
    '735': 'Český Těšín – Těrlicko, střed (some trips from Třinec or on to Havířov and Třanovice) at irregular times: Těšín 13:00, 14:50, 15:50, 16:50, 18:55; Těrlicko 13:35, 15:09, 16:52, 17:38, 19:25. Every 96, Těšín 16:50 and Těrlicko 16:52 (both exact; 13:38 / 15:14 and 13:40 / 15:16 come within 5–7 min of 13:35 and 15:09), two buses as published. Off the pattern 15:50 (its bus comes back at 16:52), 13:00, 14:50, 18:55 out and 17:38, 19:25 back.',
    '736': 'Český Těšín – Chotěbuz at irregular minutes (Těšín 13:35, 14:25, 14:55, 16:20, 17:20, 18:55; Chotěbuz 13:55, 14:45, 15:20, 16:40, 17:40, 19:20). One bus every 160 with two slots each way, on the two rounds of 73-0003: Těšín 13:35 and 14:25, Chotěbuz 13:55 and 14:45, all exact; 18:55 out is exact too. 14:55 / 15:20 (73-0031) and the later rounds (5–15 min) are off the pattern.',
    '738': 'Svibice, Slovenská – Karviná every 30 most of the day (Slovenská :17 / :47, Karviná :12 / :42), but in the afternoon peak extra trips make it three an hour at shifted minutes: Slovenská 13:52, 14:17, 14:37, 14:57, 15:22, 15:47; Karviná 13:57, 14:34, 14:52, 15:12, 15:39. Every 30 leaves half its peak slots without a trip, and no later model hour fits every 30 either (the minutes settle only after 17:00). So every 90 with four slots each way, at the peak rate: Slovenská 13:52, 14:17, 14:37, 14:57 (repeating 15:22, 15:47), all six exact; Karviná 14:34, 14:52, 15:12, 15:39 exact, 13:57 off by 12. The real buses turn at Slovenská in 1 min. Four buses (every 30 needs three: owner check).',
    '745': 'Komorní Lhotka – Hnojník, obch.stř.: one bus shuttles at irregular minutes, some trips go on to Třanovice (745 Třanovice). The main rows count only the trips that turn at Hnojník; the Třanovice trips are 745 Třanovice’s, not folded in. Model hours (14:10–16:10): Lhotka 14:16 out, Hnojník 14:35, 15:05, 15:37 back; the extra Hnojník departures are buses of other rows (15:05: 73-0022, which came on 750’s short from Třinec; 15:37: 73-0028 back from Třanovice by the 15:11 Třanovice – Hnojník short). Every 120, Lhotka 14:16 and Hnojník 15:37, one bus; 14:35 and 15:05 and the evening trips (Lhotka 17:31–20:11, Hnojník 18:12–20:47) are off the pattern. 745 Třanovice: every 120, Lhotka 15:31 to Třanovice and back 16:06 (the round of 73-0022), one bus; 13:21, 14:51, 16:31 out and 17:06 back are off the pattern.',
    '747': 'Český Těšín – Vělopolí – Střítež hourly in the afternoon: Těšín :45 (14:45, 15:45, 16:45), Střítež :15 (16:15, 17:15). One bus every 60, exact; 15:20 from Hnojník (5 min), the morning and midday trips and the Hnojník school trips are off the pattern.',
    '748': 'Střítež – Řeka: one bus shuttles all afternoon (73-0027 from 15:14). Střítež hourly at :11 (16:11, 17:11), Řeka 15:40, 16:30, 17:35. Every 120: Střítež 16:11 and 17:11 (the hourly :11 as two slots), Řeka 15:40 and 16:30, all exact; 17:35 (5 min), 19:01 and the Třinec – Řeka trips are off the pattern. One bus.',
    '750': 'Třinec – Hnojník – Dobrá – Frýdek-Místek. In the afternoon the trips run as a shift wave: out of Třinec 12:35, 12:50, 13:25, 13:50, 14:20 and then not until 16:45; out of Frýdek 13:18, 14:20, 14:35, 14:50, 15:35, 15:40, 16:40. In the model hours (13:50–15:50) two leave Třinec and five leave Frýdek; the extra Frýdek departures are buses that came in on 739 and 751 and change line number there (73-0007, 73-0001, 73-0005, 73-0038). So the line runs at Třinec’s rate: every 180 with two slots each way, on the real rounds of 73-0026 (Třinec 13:50 → Frýdek 14:50) and 73-0006 (14:20 → 15:40), all exact, two buses. The other afternoon trips are off the pattern (751 and 752 run the same road).',
    '754': 'Třinec – Ropice – Český Těšín about hourly at irregular minutes, with extras at 13:45 and 14:22; every afternoon trip is a different bus going on to another line (the 73- buses rotate between 732–754 at both bus stations). Every 144 with three slots each way: Třinec 13:45, 14:22, 15:30 and Těšín 13:40, 14:20, 15:10, all exact (13:06 / 16:09 and 16:04 / 17:34 come within 4–6 min of 13:10, 16:15 and 16:10); 14:15 is off by 7. Two buses.',
    # ---------------- MHD Český Těšín
    '721': 'Circle via Hrabinská, the central cemetery, Mosty and Svibice about every 40 at irregular minutes (diversion timetable via Nová Tovární to 12 Dec): 13:25, 14:15, 14:51, 15:31, 15:50, 17:14. Every 120 with three slots: 14:15, 14:51, 15:31, all exact, one bus; 12:46 and 13:25 (5–6 min), 15:50 and the evening trips are off the pattern, and the Lípová short trips have no line of their own. 721 Mosty: station – Mosty, osada Antoníček – Nová Tovární (station 12:55, 13:55, 15:00, 16:26; Antoníček 13:19, 14:19, 15:24, 16:44): every 144 with two slots, station 13:55 and 15:00, Antoníček 14:19 and 15:24 (the rounds of 1TI2913), all exact, back to the station empty, one bus; 12:55 and 16:26 (7 min) are off the pattern.',
    '722': 'The same circle the other way round: 13:22, 14:01, 14:25, 14:55, 15:15, 16:05, 16:35, 18:15. The model hours hold five trips, two of them 20 min apart (14:55, 15:15), so one bus cannot run them. Every 180 with five slots: 13:22, 14:01, 14:25, 14:55, 15:15, all exact, two buses; 16:05 and 16:35 (13–17 min) are off the pattern. Every 40 with one bus, as before, leaves two of its three model-hour slots without a trip (owner check).',
    '723': 'Station – bus station – Dolní and Horní Žukov hourly: station :35 most of the day (15:35, 16:39 in the model hours), Horní Žukov :00 (16:00, 17:02). Every 60, station :37 (within 2 min of 15:35 and 16:39) and Horní Žukov :00, one bus; the station slot is timed so the bus passes the bus station at :44.',
    '724': 'Station – Na Mojském – central cemetery: two rounds a day (10:22, 18:25), every 480. The cemetery stops have no other line.',
    # ---------------- MHD Třinec
    '701': 'Circle from Sosna hospital via the station and Lyžbice every 30 (:00 / :30), two buses.',
    '702': 'Kanada, školy – bus station – station: frequent only 12:40–15:22 (and in the morning), at irregular minutes, every trip on a bus that comes from or goes on to another Třinec line. Every 90 with four slots each way, on the 13:00–15:00 departures: Kanada 13:05, 13:25, 13:50, 14:05 (the 14:35 slot has no trip); bus station 13:05, 13:25, 13:35, 14:05 (13:25 has none; 13:10 and 13:50 are off the pattern). Two buses; one bus every 40 (as until 25 Oct) leaves two window slots empty (owner check).',
    '703': 'Bus station – Konská, PZ (the works): shift trips, three buses out at 13:18–13:30 and two back at 14:03 / 14:08, and the same at the other shift changes (5:14–5:30 out, 6:05 / 6:10 back; 21:23 / 21:26 out, 22:05–22:15 back). A shift line, so every 480 (as 709): bus station 13:18, 13:30 (5:18 / 5:30 and 21:18 / 21:30 within 2–5 min of the other shifts), PZ 14:03, 14:08 (6:03 / 6:08, 22:03 / 22:08 within 2 min). Two buses (owner check: one bus, the 13:30 / 14:03 round off). 13:21 from Kamionka passes the bus station 3 min off the 13:18 slot; the 12:10 / 12:25 and 17:30 / 18:12 rounds and the morning 7:49 / 7:59 are off the pattern (their stops are on the line).',
    '704': 'Bus station – Konská, Podlesí about hourly (:45 out, :03 back most of the day) with holes; in the afternoon 13:35, 14:30, 14:45 out and 13:52, 15:00 back. Every 120 with two slots: bus station 13:35 and 14:45, Podlesí 13:52 and 15:00, one bus (it turns at Podlesí 14:57 → 15:00 as the real one does). 14:30 and the evening trips (16:45 on, 17:10, 17:45) are off the pattern or on it only at even hours. The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec) runs.',
    '706': 'Bus station – Kojkovice and bus station – Osůvky – Borek are two branch lines until 15:00 (Kojkovice 13:40, 14:35, back 13:05, 13:55; Osůvky 13:35, 14:30, back 13:05, 14:01); from 15:35 (and at 8:35, 10:45) one trip an hour runs via Osůvky and Borek to Kojkovice, :35 out, :00 / :55 back. Those combined trips are off both rows (their stops are on 706 and 706 Osůvky). Each branch is one bus every 120 with two slots each way, exact in 13:00–15:00, the two 5 min apart at the bus station.',
    '707': 'Circle via Horní and Dolní Líštná hourly at :35 (14:35–18:35; 13:40 and 12:45 before). The short circle to Horní Líštná, státní hranice only (12:10, 14:39), and the morning trips that skip Valovka, serve stops of the full circle and are off the pattern. One bus.',
    '708': 'Bus station – Lyžbice, Kamionka every 30: in the morning 8:15–12:15 (:15 / :45, back :14 / :44) and in the afternoon 14:45–16:45 out (:15 / :45, the first three from the station) and 15:13–17:09 back (:09 / :39). The model hour is set to that run (15:10–17:10; the default 15:30–17:30 runs past its end). Every 30, bus station :15, Kamionka :09, two buses, as the real ones (1TD1410, 71-1157) work it.',
    '709': 'Works trips to Konská, válcovna C at the shift change (13:30 / 14:09), every 480. Válcovna C has no other line.',
    '712': 'Station – Tyra hourly at :40 most of the day; in the afternoon 13:33 and 14:22 instead of 13:40 / 14:40, then 15:40, 16:40. Back from Tyra about :05 at pila. Every 120 with two slots: station 14:22 and 15:40, Tyra 15:00 and 15:44 (at pila 15:02, 15:46), timed so the bus passes Tyra, pila on time; two buses. 16:40, 18:40 (even hours) and 16:05, 17:10 back are off the pattern. The Kozinec trips every 4 h (14:35 / 14:58) are 712 Kozinec.',
    '768': 'Bus station – Vendryně, vápenka: shift trips (12:41 / 13:02), every 480. Vápenka and stadion have no other line.',
    '713': 'Bus station – Guty hourly (:45 / :05).',
    '714': 'Bus station – Oldřichovice, ves: a few trips (13:37, 14:30 out; 13:00, 14:03 back in the afternoon). Every 120 with two slots each way on those, one bus. 12:40 (from the station), 15:45 and 16:05 are off the pattern; 14:55 runs to restaurace only.',
    '715': 'Circle from Sosna hospital at :10 and :50 (8:10–12:10 and 14:50–17:10, two buses); 13:25, 13:50 and 14:15 between are a midday shift rhythm, and 13:30 from the bus station is a short trip to Sosna. Model hour 16:00, where the circle’s own pattern runs (by its Sosna departures 13:20–15:20 has one more than 15:00–17:00). Every 60 with two slots, :10 and :50, two buses.',
    '716': 'Bus station – Nebory – Guty at irregular times (14:20, 15:35, 16:20, 18:48 out; 15:00, 16:10, 16:55 back), two rounds in the afternoon peak (15:35 → 16:10, 16:20 → 16:55; each bus turns in 1 min at Guty). Every 120 with two slots each way: bus station 14:20 and 15:35, Guty 16:10 and 16:55; two buses, as two ran (owner check: one bus every 120, half the rate). 13:10, 18:48 and 15:00 back are off the pattern. The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec, 21 trips instead of 7) runs.',
    # ---------------- MHD Frýdek-Místek
    '301': 'Riviéra – Lískovec, Marlenka four times an hour. Riviéra leaves at :03, :13, :33 and :43 until 15:43; Marlenka at :03, :13, :33, :43 until 14:03 and at :03, :23, :33, :43 from 14:23: its :23 is the bus that leaves Riviéra at :43, runs on past Marlenka to Řepiště, U kříže and comes back through Marlenka (the Řepiště stops are on 311). The Simutrans line is every 60 with four slots at each end, exact 14:13–16:03 both ways; 5 buses, one of them waits 55 min at Riviéra, where the real buses go on as 311 or 302 (pooling is the owner’s choice). From 16:08 the line runs every 30 at :08 / :38; those trips are 5 min off the pattern.',
    '302': 'Frýdecká skládka – Riviéra every 30 (skládka :12 / :42, Riviéra :27 / :57) from 12:12; Riviéra’s last afternoon departure is 16:57 (then 18:36), so the model hours are 15:00–17:00 (anchor set by hand to 15:30; at the default 16:00 the 17:27 slot has no trip). At the shift changes (5:12–6:58 and 13:12–14:52) these trips run on from Riviéra to Tesco: that is 302 Tesco, a Riviéra – Tesco shuttle every 480 at their times there (13:41, 14:11, 14:41; back 13:52, 14:22, 14:52), so no bus is counted twice.',
    '303': 'Dobrá, VÚHŽ – Frýdek – Baška hourly (Dobrá :35 from 8:35 to 16:35, Baška :27 from 7:27 to 15:27); the Hodoňovice branch hourly as 303 Hodoňovice (Frýdek, Dobrovského :59 from 7:59 to 16:59, Kamenec :52). Model hours 14:00–16:00 (anchor set by hand to 14:30): from 16:27 the back trips swap paths (Baška 16:27 and 17:27 run to Frýdek, Dobrovského; Kamenec 16:47 runs to Dobrá), so the back pattern ends inside the default window. Those evening trips are off the pattern; their stops are on the two lines.',
    '304': 'Frýdek, station – Palkovice – Kozlovice hourly (:32 / :37).',
    '305': 'Frýdek, station – Fryčovice – Horní Sklenov hourly at irregular minutes out (13:09, 14:23, 15:08, 16:08, 17:12, 18:36), back at :59 (13:59, 15:59, 16:59). Every 120 with two slots out (even hours :08, odd hours :12: 16:08 and 17:12 exact) and :59 every hour back; 2 buses. Off the pattern: 14:23, 15:08 (4 min), 18:36; back 15:09, 19:24.',
    '306': 'Pavlíkova točna – Frýdek bus station hourly (:50 / :03), on the minute all afternoon.',
    '307': 'Letná – poliklinika hourly (:18 / :15).',
    '308': 'Skalice, Záhoří – poliklinika about hourly with gaps (poliklinika 15:28, 16:13, 17:28; Záhoří 14:57, 15:57, 17:57). One bus every 120 on the odd-hour round (poliklinika :28, Záhoří :57: 15:28, 15:57, 17:28, 17:57 exact); 14:57, 16:13 and the 14:28 through trip from Mitrovice are off the pattern. The Mitrovice trips (3 out, 4 back a day) are 308 Mitrovice every 480 on the real round poliklinika 13:19 → Mitrovice 13:46, back 14:01; 15:04 out is off the pattern. Paskov, nadjezd and Paskov, Břehy have no other line.',
    '309': 'Circle from the poliklinika every 30 (:15 / :45), one bus.',
    '310': 'Circle from the poliklinika hourly at :15 until 14:15, every 30 at :00 / :30 from 14:30 to 16:00, then 17:00 and 18:03. Modelled at its peak: one bus every 30 at :00 (14:30–16:00 exact); the :15 trips and the evening ones are off the pattern.',
    '311': 'Riviéra – Řepiště every 30 (Riviéra :23 / :53 to 17:23). Řepiště, U kříže leaves at :12 / :42 until 13:42, then at :03 / :42 (14:03, 14:42, 15:03, 15:42, 16:03), then 17:12. The Simutrans line is every 60 with two slots at each end (Riviéra :23, :53; U kříže :03, :42), exact in 13:10–15:10; 3 buses. Off the pattern: U kříže 12:12, 13:12, 17:12 (9 min), 18:15, 19:15; Riviéra 18:34, 19:35.',
    '312': 'Frýdek, station – Staříč – Fryčovice – Brušperk: out every 30 in the peak (station 14:02, 14:35, 15:05, 15:35, 16:05, 16:35, 17:35), back from Brušperk at irregular times, half of them to the station and half ending at the poliklinika (13:47, 14:47, 15:20, 15:41, 16:40, 17:20, 18:20): the way back is read at Místek, poliklinika, which all of them pass. Every 96 with two slots each way (station 13:59 (real 14:02), 14:35, 15:35; Brušperk 14:47, 15:20), so each bus turns in 3–6 min as the real ones do; 2 buses. Off the pattern: out 15:05, 16:05, 16:35, 17:35; back 15:41, 16:40, 17:20 (stops on the line).',
    '313': 'Frýdek, station – Dobrá – Nošovice: a few trips a day. In the afternoon one bus runs station 13:31 → Nošovice 13:49 → 14:10 back (bus 689); 12:38 and 16:38 go out, 15:00 and 17:07 come back. One bus every 120 on the 13:31 / 14:10 round (odd hours :31 at the station, even hours :10 at Nošovice); the other trips are off the pattern.',
    '314': 'Frýdek – Staré Město – Baška – Pržno – Janovice. The trips start at the Frýdek station, the poliklinika or Revoluční and end at Janovice, konečná or škola, so both ways are read at Baška, železniční stanice, which they all pass (towards Janovice 13:52, 14:39, 15:10, 16:20, 17:25; towards Frýdek 13:12, 14:36, 15:19, 15:59, 16:58, 18:03). In Frýdek the afternoon trips use Revoluční (13:33, 14:20, 17:06 from the poliklinika pass it; 14:57, 16:07 start there; 14:17, 15:00 end there), the station only 15:35 and the Baška shorts, so the town end is Revoluční, where the two Frýdek paths meet at Na Veselé (until 25 Oct 2026 it was the station: three of the four slots were Revoluční trips). Every 120 with two slots each way, timed at the ends so the bus passes Baška station at 14:39 / 15:10 and 14:36 / 15:59 (Revoluční 14:26, 14:57, both exact; Janovice 14:12, 15:35); 2 buses, as 724 and 709 ran it. The 15:59 slot is the 15:35 trip, which ends at the station: with 15:19 (the 15:00 škola trip, to Revoluční) instead, one bus cannot chain the slots and 314 needs 3. Off the pattern at Baška: 13:52, 16:20, 17:25 out; 13:12, 15:19, 16:58, 18:03 back. Staré Město, u hřbitova, Baška, železniční stanice and Baška, rozcestí Janovice have no other line.',
    '316': 'In the afternoon one bus goes out as 315 (poliklinika 13:12, 14:13, 15:42, via Chlebovice) and comes back as 316 (Palkovice, centrum 13:43, 14:45, 16:15, via Zelinkovice); the Simutrans line 316 is that round every 90 (poliklinika 14:12 (real 14:13), 15:42; centrum 14:45, 16:15), with its own model hours 14:00–16:00, because the round ends with the 15:42 / 16:15 trip inside the line’s 15:30–17:30. 13:12 and 13:43 are off the pattern. The short Pavlíkova – Riviéra trips (hourly 15:12–17:21) are 316 Riviéra. Both diversion timetables (to 12 Dec) run.',
    '318': 'Poliklinika – Raškovice – Krásná, hotel Visalaje, read at Raškovice, hotel Ondráš, where the short trips turn. Full-route trips out of the poliklinika 13:50, 14:58, 16:58, 18:58; back from Visalaje 13:42, 14:48, 16:00, 18:05 (Ondráš 14:10, 15:10, 16:28, 18:26); short Ondráš trips 12:33 and 13:15 out, 13:03 and 13:53 back. Every 240 on the two full-route rounds of the model hours (poliklinika 13:50, 14:58; Visalaje 13:48 (real 13:42, a trip 6 min slower to Ondráš), 14:48, passing Ondráš at 14:10 / 15:10); 2 buses. Off the pattern: the Ondráš short trips (their stops are on the line), out 16:58, back 16:00 and 18:05.',
    # ---------------- Frýdlantsko (added 21 Oct)
    '340': 'Frýdlant – Pržno – Janovice – Frýdek-Místek – Vratimov – Ostrava: a few through trips a day (Frýdlant 12:06 and 20:08 to Ostrava; Ostrava 5:50, 14:12, 22:05 back), every 480 on the afternoon pair (Frýdlant 12:06, Ostrava 14:12, which ends at Frýdek, Revoluční). Modelled because Ostrava, Kunčice, nádraží Kunčice has no other afternoon line, so the way out takes the path through Kunčice, as the 14:12 runs (and on to Frýdlant as the 22:05; until 25 Oct 2026 it took the path of the 5:50, through Hrabůvka and served Kunčice only on the way back). The short Frýdlant – Místek, Anenská trips (14:20, 14:26, 15:06) are off the pattern.',
    '341': 'Frýdlant – Pržno – Janovice: one bus every 120 on the afternoon round Frýdlant 14:19 → Janovice 14:43, back 15:00 (Frýdlant :19 in even hours, Janovice :00 in odd hours; 17:00 exact too). Off the pattern: Frýdlant 16:34 and 18:04 (15 min), Janovice 12:30 and 18:30; the 13:34 to Janovice, škola and its 14:00 return are short trips.',
    '342': 'Frýdlant – Metylovice – Lhotka – Kozlovice, about every 2 h at irregular minutes (Frýdlant 12:20, 14:45, 16:25; Kozlovice 13:44, 15:19, 16:49). One bus every 120 on the 16:25 / 16:49 pair.',
    '343': 'Frýdlant – Čeladná, restaurace Kněhyně. Modelled at 14:00 (set by hand): after 16:06 the line has only the 16:50 out, whose bus (32-1006) stays in Čeladná for the station – Kněhyně short trips, so the line’s own round (32-1101: Podolánky 12:20, Kněhyně 14:10, Podolánky 15:00) runs 12:20 – 16:06. One bus every 80: Frýdlant 14:10 (16:50 and 8:50 exact), Kněhyně 14:35. The Podolánky trips (Frýdlant 12:20, 15:00; back 12:55, 15:35, passing Kněhyně) are 343 Podolánky every 480 on 15:00 / 15:35 and are not read into the main row; Podolánky has no other line. The Čeladná station – Kněhyně short trips 17:20 – 19:40 are not a line of their own.',
    '344': 'Frýdlant – Raškovice at no fixed minute in the afternoon (Frýdlant 13:35, 14:30, 15:10, 16:05; Raškovice, hotel Ondráš 13:20, 14:10, 15:20, 17:08). Every 120 with two slots each way, exact in the model hours: Frýdlant 14:30 (even hours) and 15:10 (odd hours), Ondráš 13:20 (odd) and 14:10 (even); the plates chain 13:20 → 14:30 (32-1108) and 14:10 → 15:10 (32-1102). Off the pattern: Frýdlant 12:05, 13:35, 16:05, 18:05 (25 min); Ondráš 17:08, 19:08. The Hyundai shift trips (12:35 out, 14:25 back via Ondráš 14:50), the trips beyond to Raškovice pošta and škola and the Pržno trips use stops other lines serve. Two buses.',
    '345': 'Frýdlant – Malenovice, parkoviště hourly at :55 / :25 from 15:55 (15:55, 16:55; back 16:25, 17:25), one bus. Modelled at 16:00 (set by hand): line_anchor moved it to 14:00 only for the 14:05 zahradnictví – station hop and the Hutě trips; on the line’s own trips the busiest two hours are within one departure of 15:00 – 17:00. Off the pattern: 13:30 and 14:40 out, 13:42 and 14:55 back. The trips on to Malenovice, Hutě are 345 Hutě every 480 (15:00 / 15:22; 6:55 / 7:12 in the morning) and are not read into the main row: Hutě has no other line.',
    '346': 'Loop Frýdlant – Pstruží – Frýdlant every 90 with two slots: from the station 13:54 and 15:24, and 12:52, 14:22, 15:52 (the trips from zahradnictví, timed as they pass the station); 17:20 and 18:50 are 2 min off. One bus (it is back from the 13:54 loop at 14:20 and leaves again at 14:22).',
    '347': 'Frýdlant – Metylovice – Palkovice, transformátor: four afternoon rounds (Frýdlant 12:45, 13:55, 14:25, 15:30; transformátor back 13:07, 14:22, 14:57, 15:57). One bus every 120 with two slots each way, exact in the model hours: Frýdlant 14:25 (even hours) and 15:30 (odd hours), transformátor :57 every hour, timed so the bus passes Palkovice, Tomis parkoviště at :00. Off the pattern: Frýdlant 12:45 and 13:55 (20, 25 min); back 13:07 and 14:22. The evening trips end at Tomis parkoviště.',
    '348': 'Frýdlant – Ostravice – Staré Hamry – Bílá, zámeček: hourly from Frýdlant at :53 in the afternoon (13:53, 14:53, 15:53), back from Bílá 14:31 and 15:16. Every 120 with two slots each way, exact in the model hours: Frýdlant :53 every hour, Bílá 14:31 (even hours) and 15:16 (odd hours). Three buses, as the real ones (32-1105, 32-1104, 401) work it with 349: the 14:53 and 15:53 buses stay at Bílá for the Bílá – Ostravice trips (Bílá :06, Ostravice :34 from 16:06), whose stops are all on the main line, so they have no line of their own. Off the pattern: Frýdlant 12:23, Bílá 12:01.',
    '349': 'Bílá, zámeček – Bílá, Konečná (state border) every 1½ h (zámeček 16:36, Konečná 16:50; 13:08, 15:26, 19:06 are off the pattern). Konečná has no other line.',
    # ---------------- Frýdecko-Místecko
    '351': 'Ostrava – Frýdek – Dobrá – Raškovice – Morávka, Lipové. An outstation line: in the afternoon the buses go out and stay in Morávka (33-1013 out at 13:43 and 33-1007 at 16:43 end at Lipové; the 15:43 bus goes on to 314) and only two come back from Lipové (14:16 to Ostrava, 16:26 to Místek, Anenská). So the line runs at its inbound rate, every 120: Ostrava :43 in odd hours (13:43, 15:43; timed so the bus passes Frýdek, autobusové nádraží at :25), Lipové :26 in even hours (16:26). Off the pattern: Ostrava 15:08 and 16:43 (buses going home), the Anenská – Lipové trips (12:34, 19:24) and the Ostrava – Frýdek short trips; back 12:56 and 14:16 (10 min). The Bebek trips are 351 Bebek every 180 (Ostrava 14:43, Bebek 15:18) and are not read into the main row; its 17:42 passes Frýdek 3 min before 351’s 17:43 slot. Three buses.',
    '354': 'Frýdek – Vratimov – Ostrava shift trips (Frýdek 14:05, Ostrava 5:00), every 480. Paskov, náměstí has no other line.',
    '355': 'Frýdek – Příbor – Mošnov, Airport shift trips (12:51 / 14:17), every 480. The Příbor and Mošnov industrial zone stops have no other line.',
    '357': 'Frýdek – Dobrá – Dobratice – Vojkovice every 4 h.',
    '358': 'Krytý bazén – Nošovice, Hyundai: shift trips every 8 h (Krytý bazén 5:03, 13:03, 21:03; Hyundai 6:25, 14:25, 22:25), so the line is every 480 on the 13:03 / 14:25 pair, exact all day. The Hyundai Steel trips (Riviéra 4:53, 12:53, 20:53 via Krytý bazén; IZS 14:17 back) are 358 Steel every 480 (Riviéra 12:53, IZS 14:17) and are not read into the main row. The Frýdek, autobusové nádraží – Hyundai trips (9:55, 10:30, 14:50, 15:58, 19:30) have no line; their stops are on 358, 351 and 357. One bus each.',
    '980': 'Ostrava – Frýdek – Frenštát – Rožnov every 30 in the afternoon: Ostrava :23 / :53 (14:23 – 16:23), Rožnov :05 / :35 (13:35 – 15:05); the bus passes Frenštát, u škol at :27 / :57. Approximate out of Ostrava: the 13:53 slot stands for the 13:40 (13 min; every 30 starts at 14:23). Off the pattern: the Frenštát short trips (Ostrava 14:05 and 17:25 to Frenštát; Frenštát 13:32, 14:17 on Z-Group’s licence 883980, 15:42 and 17:27 to Ostrava) and the evening, when the line thins (Rožnov 16:05, 17:35; the Rožnov 15:35 and 16:35 and Ostrava 13:53 and 16:53 are 985 Rožnov’s). Seven buses.',
    '985': 'Ostrava – Frýdek – Metylovice – Frenštát. In the afternoon the Frenštát short trips are a shift burst out of Ostrava every 30, 14:33 – 16:03, half of them on Z-Group’s licence 883985; few trips come back. The live map shows how the buses run: 32-1002 comes in from Frenštát at 12:47 and goes out at 14:33, and Z-Group 63-1011 comes in at 14:42 and goes out at 16:03. Those two rounds are 985, every 480 with two slots each way. The 15:03 (33-1015) and 15:33 (63-1005, which came in on 980 at 14:17) go out after other trips: 985B, out only with an empty return, as 543B on the Havířovsko/Karvinsko/Orlovsko sheet. The trips on to Rožnov are 985 Rožnov, every 180 on its real trips: Ostrava 13:53 and 16:53, Rožnov 16:35 (19:35 in the evening); Ostrava 11:20, 12:20, 13:13 and Rožnov 15:35 are off the pattern. Its minutes are 980’s (Ostrava :53, Rožnov :35): the real 985 Rožnov trips are the shoulders of 980’s every 30 on the Frenštát – Rožnov road.',
}
